hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"485","Jabir ibn 'Abdullah reported that the Prophet"
"486","Jabir reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"487","Ibn 'Umar reported that the Prophet"
"488","Abu Sa'id reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"489","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"490","Jabir reported that the Prophet"
"491","Masruq and Shutayr ibn Shakal met in the mosque.\nThe people sitting in circles in the mosque moved towards them. Masruq\nsaid"
"492","My slaves!\nI have forbidden injustice for Myself and I have made it forbidden among\nyou"
